docs/superpowers/
docs/IMPLEMENTATION.md
docs/specs/
# Artifacts pulled off a GPU pod by `ci/scripts/gpu-dev.sh pull`.
.gpu-pull/

# The full TRAIN-side pair text `cookbook/book/scripts/derive_heldout_fixture.py
# --emit-train-pairs` writes (`ci/scripts/perf/finetune_run_ab.sh` generates it
# when absent). Never committed, for repository size (`cookbook/fixtures/
# finetune_heldout/README.md`, "Why train text isn't committed"): its identity
# is checked against the committed `train_ids_sha256.json` by
# `ci/scripts/perf/verify_train_pairs.py`.
cookbook/fixtures/finetune_heldout/train_pairs.jsonl

# Local scratch: working notes and throwaway git worktrees.
/scratchpad/
/scratch-worktrees/

# The PyTorch/PEFT reference venv `ci/scripts/perf/finetune_ab.sh` provisions
# on the pod (crates/jammi-bench/reference/README.md's own `.venv-torch-ref`
# convention) and the A/B sweep's merged report + table it writes.
.venv-torch-ref/
.ab-report/

# Local secrets for `docker compose -f deploy/docker-compose.yml up` (the
# audit master key; see `deploy/.env.example`) — never committed.
deploy/.env
